<title>ISRAEL: Jerusalem death toll rises to 15.</title>
<headline>Jerusalem death toll rises to 15.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The death toll from a double suicide bombing in a Jerusalem market on Wednesday rose to 15 after a woman wounded in the attack died on the operating table, a spokeswoman for Bikur Holim hospital said.</p>
<p>Police said 13 people in the street market and the two Arab suicide bombers were killed in the blasts.</p>
</text>
